&=\dfrac{(1+\sqrt{2})(1-\sqrt{2})}{(2+\sqrt{3})(2-\sqrt{3})}}-\dfrac{\sqrt{6}}{2}\\
&=\dfrac{1-2}{2^2-(\sqrt{3}\cdot\sqrt{2})^2}}-\dfrac{\sqrt{6}}{2}\\
&=\dfrac{-1}{8-\sqrt{12}}\\
&=\dfrac{-1}{8-\sqrt{4}\sqrt{3}}\\
&=\dfrac{-1}{8-\sqrt{4}\sqrt{3}\cdot\dfrac{\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{4}}{\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{4}}}=\dfrac{-1}{8-\sqrt{12}(\dfrac{\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{4}}{\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{4}})}\\
&=\dfrac{-1}{8-\sqrt{12}\cdot\dfrac{\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{4}}{\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{4}}}=\dfrac{-1}{8-\dfrac{\sqrt{12}(\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{4})}{\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{4}}}=\dfrac{-1}{8-\dfrac{\sqrt{3}\cdot2\sqrt{3}}{\sqrt{4}+\sqrt{4}}}=\dfrac{-1}{8-\dfrac{2\sqrt{3}}{2}}=\dfrac{-1}{8-2\sqrt{3}}\\
&=\dfrac{\dfrac{-1}{2}}{4-(\sqrt{3}\cdot\sqrt{2})^2}}=\dfrac{\dfrac{-1}{2}}{4-\sqrt{6}\sqrt{2}}=\dfrac{\dfrac{-1}{2}}{4-\sqrt{12}\cdot\dfrac{\sqrt{2}+\sqrt{2}}{\sqrt{2}+\sqrt{2}}}=\dfrac{\dfrac{-1}{2}}{4-\sqrt{12}(\dfrac{\sqrt{2}+\sqrt{2}}{\sqrt{2}+\sqrt{2}})}=\dfrac{\dfrac{-1}{2}}{4-\dfrac{\sqrt{12}(\sqrt{2}+\sqrt{2})}{\sqrt{2}+\sqrt{2}}}=\dfrac{\dfrac{-1}{2}}{4-\dfrac{2(\sqrt{6}\sqrt{2})}{\sqrt{2}+\sqrt{2}}}=\dfrac{\dfrac{-1}{2}}{4-2\sqrt{3}}=4 + 2\sqrt{3}
\end{align*}
最終的に $4+2\sqrt{3}$ となるので、$A=4, B=3, C=6, D=12$ であるので、$A+B+C+D=4+3+6+12=25$ である。

